{
    "title": "Manta: Comics & Graphic Novels",
    "description": "Welcome to Manta \u2013 Your Ultimate Comics and Novels Destination!\r\n\r\nDive into the captivating worlds of Manta \u2013 where best-in-class comics (manhwa, manga, manhua) and novels await. From romance to action, fantasy to horror, BL (yaoi) to romantasy, our library offers an extensive range of stories to explore and enjoy. With Manta, immersive storytelling, stunning artwork, and boundless creativity are always at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nDiscover Your Next Favorite Story\r\n\r\n- Try our hit series Under the Oak Tree, a fan-favorite loved by millions worldwide.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Romance fan? We\u2019re your go-to for epic love tales, featuring exclusives like Tempest Night, Predatory Marriage, Betrayal of Dignity, I\u2019ve Become a True Villainess, Redemption of the Earl of Nottingham, High Society, and more\r\n\r\n\r\n- Searching for BL? We\u2019re the perfect choice with popular BL titles like Semantic Error, Love Jinx, No Love Zone, The New Recruit, The Dangerous Convenience Store, The Dirtiest High, and many more!\r\n\r\n\r\n- Craving more after the comics? Discover original novels that delve deeper into each world, revealing new layers of the characters and their stories.\r\n\r\nChoose from our subscription library for unlimited access to exclusive tales, or select individual episodes from a larger library to satisfy your unique story cravings.\r\n\r\nFor more, please visit:\r\n\r\nWebsite: http://www.manta.net\r\nInstagram: http://instagram.com/mantacomics\r\nTwitter: http://twitter.com/mantacomics\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://mantasupport.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056564334-Privacy-Policy\r\nTerms of Use: https://mantasupport.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056568354-Terms-of-Service",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Manta \u2013 Your Ultimate Comics and Novels Destination!<br><br>Dive into the captivating worlds of Manta \u2013 where best-in-class comics (manhwa, manga, manhua) and novels await. From romance to action, fantasy to horror, BL (yaoi) to romantasy, our library offers an extensive range of stories to explore and enjoy. With Manta, immersive storytelling, stunning artwork, and boundless creativity are always at your fingertips.<br><br>Discover Your Next Favorite Story<br><br>- Try our hit series Under the Oak Tree, a fan-favorite loved by millions worldwide.<br><br><br>- Romance fan? We\u2019re your go-to for epic love tales, featuring exclusives like Tempest Night, Predatory Marriage, Betrayal of Dignity, I\u2019ve Become a True Villainess, Redemption of the Earl of Nottingham, High Society, and more<br><br><br>- Searching for BL? We\u2019re the perfect choice with popular BL titles like Semantic Error, Love Jinx, No Love Zone, The New Recruit, The Dangerous Convenience Store, The Dirtiest High, and many more!<br><br><br>- Craving more after the comics? Discover original novels that delve deeper into each world, revealing new layers of the characters and their stories.<br><br>Choose from our subscription library for unlimited access to exclusive tales, or select individual episodes from a larger library to satisfy your unique story cravings.<br><br>For more, please visit:<br><br>Website: http://www.manta.net<br>Instagram: http://instagram.com/mantacomics<br>Twitter: http://twitter.com/mantacomics<br>Privacy Policy: https://mantasupport.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056564334-Privacy-Policy<br>Terms of Use: https://mantasupport.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056568354-Terms-of-Service",
